-The core problem is that “capacity” is not CPU or bandwidth—it’s *provider tolerance*, which varies by domain and changes minute-to-minute. The reputation engine therefore owns a simple contract: for each (tenant, domain), produce a token budget per time window and an IP pool choice, based on recent outcomes.
